{"v":4,"catch":"擊敗威脅你和平世界的 Warudemon 惡棍！","desc":"《WONDER MOMO》是NAMCO（BANDAI NAMCO Entertainment Inc.) 於1987年發行的動作遊戲。\n控制英雄莫莫，並擊敗 Warudemon 惡棍，以保持世界和平。\n駕馭旋風變身為 WONDER MOMO，並使用 Wonder Ring 和特殊動作為你作為裝扮英雄的成功而戰！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-03-31","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1701c3f97112f8ae1cec0f63cd59a2213a4651f64d9cf98877ab7e038ee310fa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a8712e28e1a9662afe814886a57b3426b6f690253fb209159626d4026b55c00f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0ae613bc4ced4f9b6c4f5633099b92f2d00e7d824953f9fd27b9f505557c35cc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4893e44edfa315ad122a27714d65301ff716a61e0df41f92a868903a3fad31c3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bf14b5b3232f3c97d53561dddced521d161eb326779764355f61d94fd50a2eb2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d291054c5fcf042d6a48113f5ece50f815349bd10064819b34a07445bf42bf17.jpg"],"titleId":"01003960172bc000","dlc":[]}